  (296, 'c1ccb7a6-9479-4743-bd1b-ac1335058c49', 'ADAM & POTSIE HAIRDRESSING', 11, 'notes', 'Notes', '5/12/25 - After being chased on overdue invoice, Adam replied with - "Thank you for reaching out regarding the outstanding invoice. I am writing to discuss our membership. Since starting on September 30th, we have unfortunately only seen two customers utilize the Chiswick Card. Given this low level of engagement, we are concerned that our location may be too far outside the effective range for the card to be beneficial for our business. We are however relying solely on the potential new clients engaging with the Calendar website and trying not to advertise that we do take the card to our existing clientele as that would be disastrous for us. Not sure what you would suggest from here?"                                                                                                                                                                                                          I replied "A couple of thoughts on how we can help get more people through the door: We''d be happy to include you in the newsletter in the coming weeks, and then again in the new year to give you another push. If you wanted to do a short-term offer that''s a bit more generous than your usual Club Card deal - just for a limited period - we could feature that and it might grab more attention. Entirely up to you on what that looks like. We''re also getting stickers printed for Club Card businesses to display, showing you accept the card, this will hopefully help too! We can get one to you very soon. On the invoice - I do still need to get that settled, so if you could sort that when you get a chance I''d appreciate it. ust reread your email and saw the last bit about existing clientele not being aware of the deal, maybe not the stickers then! With that in mind, maybe the deal could be specific for first time visitors?                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                           03/09/25 - Reach out about joining Club Card via online form, I applied with the details. Replied saying they wanted to ahead, aiming for Tuesday September 9 launch.'),
